# These CVEs live in Hadoop-ecosystem jars (avro, zookeeper, jetty, derby, ivy,
# jackson-core, jackson-databind) that ship bundled inside the pyspark pip package's hadoop-client
# runtime. requirements.txt pins pyspark==3.5.2 / delta-spark==3.0.0 to match a
# specific Delta 3.0 runtime jar coordinate (see requirements.txt comment); the
# scanned images (streamlit, generator) never invoke Spark or touch these jars
# at runtime, so there is no reachable code path for these findings. Bumping
# past pyspark 3.5.x here would break the pinned Delta jar compatibility.
